. 
. * Consolidate WTP after blind tasting (pre-magnesium info), from wtp_2b_XYZ vars
.         gen                     wtp_after_tasting = .
{txt}(143 missing values generated)

{com}.         
.         foreach                 var in wtp_2b_584 wtp_2b_793 wtp_2b_356 wtp_2b_831 {c -(}
{txt}  2{com}.                                         replace wtp_after_tasting = `var' if wtp_after_tasting == . & `var' != .
{txt}  3{com}.                 {c )-}
{txt}(34 real changes made)
(0 real changes made)
(38 real changes made)
(0 real changes made)

