{txt}
{com}.         
. * Consolidate WTP for treatment group (with mag info given), from wtp_3b_info_XYZ vars
.         gen                     wtp_treatment_mag_info = .
{txt}(143 missing values generated)

{com}.         
.         foreach                 var in wtp_3b_info_584 wtp_3b_info_793 wtp_3b_info_356 wtp_3b_info_831 {c -(}
{txt}  2{com}.                                         replace wtp_treatment_mag_info = `var' if wtp_treatment_mag_info == . & `var' != .
{txt}  3{com}.                 {c )-}
{txt}(34 real changes made)
